2	//! [`Look`], the `video.look` a clip carries — one of the eight built-in
3	//! [`LookKind`]s or an imported `.cube` LUT (`lut`, GR-8, naming its media),
4	//! and how much of it — and each built-in kind's [`LookDefinition`], the
